{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木中で\n紹介した曲は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Creepy Nutsさんの『刹那』です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて聴いた方もいますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他に、\n『未来予想図』もバイブスあがるやつです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオで聴いただけで\nまだ発売前ですが～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分は完全に\nフリースタイルダンジョンキッズのにわかだけど\nだからこそ、この曲は痺れるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に乃木坂のメンバーとして聴いても\n自分の今とマッチしてて\nめっちゃ共感できる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後は、\n『トレンチコートマフィア』\n『合法的トビ方ノススメ』辺りは\n人にCreepy Nutsさんを薦めると\nこの2曲からハマる方が多いように思うので\n良かったら聴いてみてね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はのぎ天の生放送もありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世のMCは斬新な面白さがあって良かったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/1404052/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は珍しく髪型を\nお団子にしてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観れなかった方は\nアーカイブがあがったら観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/1404052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーナーの方はとばしていただいて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/1404052/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生ドルでーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://live.nicovideo.jp/watch/lv282739405"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/1404052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、本当に嬉しいね\nいろいろ出れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと前が嘘みたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/1404052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}